This product is the occupancy layer: one user fills free GPU streams up to
the dynamic knee (k = min(PARALLEL, k_codo), separately for P and D).
It is not a TensorFold fork. TensorFold is Apache-2.0; the overlay in
patches/tensorfold/ is applied surgically.

Hydragen (arXiv 2402.05099) is not bundled. MLA / Hydragen is Dynamo work,
outside this stack. IPPD (arXiv 2609.05707) is cited as related work.
